Same input, opposite expected output. Per the spec in the docstring, an amount-only match (no invoice ref in memo) should match an unmatched invoice with the same open amount. INV-000102 has open amount 12000 (=$120.00), so the correct behavior per spec is to match it. The regression test from issue 590 appears to contradict the spec and was flagged as not yet re-reviewed after the data-model migration. Please review and remove or fix test_regression_issue_590.

